# The University in the Community: An Overview of Humanities Out There.

**Authors:** Nanes, Erika

## Abstract
Describes the development of the Humanities Out There (HOT) program as a response to a reduction in government spending in both the sciences and humanities. Discusses how the program incorporates elements of two very different perspectives on humanities education. Describes the implementation of this outreach program and its crucial link in the chain between the university and the local schools. (SC)

